&lt;p&gt;This is a &lt;em&gt;Hybrid&lt;/em&gt; role based in Amsterdam. &lt;strong&gt;You will work from our &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Amsterdam HQ&lt;/span&gt; a minimum of 2 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At this time, we are only considering candidates who are already based in&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;the &lt;strong&gt;Netherlands&lt;/strong&gt;. As a result, &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;visa sponsorship and relocation support are not available for this position&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
