&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;A competitive &lt;u&gt;Annual Gross Base Salary&lt;/u&gt; depending on your level, competencies, and overall experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;A &lt;u&gt;Work From Home Allowance&lt;/u&gt; to help with your monthly household bills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Commuting&lt;/u&gt; between your home and our office is covered by Catawiki.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Amazing &lt;u&gt;Office&lt;/u&gt; right in the centre of Amsterdam.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text text-align-left &quot;&gt;
