&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring fresh ideas to the table:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor market trends, cultural moments, category developments and competitor activity to identify new formats, themes and opportunities worth testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure, optimise and scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Define success metrics, monitor performance and turn results into clear learnings and recommendations. Use these insights to improve future activations and scale the formats that deliver the strongest business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
